   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div> </div><div>I would like to place a &quot;?&quot; next to a slider input and attach events to it such that hover with mouse would display tool top about the slider input. I understand I can use jQuery to handle the mouse-over events.</div><div> </div><div>Are there any suggestions about how I can put &quot;?&quot; on the same row as the slider input (and not on the next row).</div><div> </div><div>Thanks</div><div>vkj</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "_FyGSam50RwJ",
   "from": "Herman Sontrop",
   "author": "e6d426c9552b1af9",
   "date": "2014-06-06T22:04:45Z",
   "subject": "Re: Placing a \"?\" next to a sliderInput",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>you can use the <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/fluidPage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/fluidPage.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403301542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw010t1dUg0UIPzfnKqXJKCR\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></span>fluidRow </a>and <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/column.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/column.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403301542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bxjeNVATrwCiAAZKh0NQV\">column </a>functions to put the ? next to the slider, see the <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/layout-guide.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/layout-guide.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403301542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3a9FtaV_BMhSvRk6dV2P1Y\">layout guide</a> for details. If you want to use tooltips etc you can use the <a href=\"https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyBS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyBS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403301542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VoldF0hqgG0G1mMhoA9l-\">shinyBS package</a>, see <a href=\"http://spark.rstudio.com/johnharrison/shinyBS-Demo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://spark.rstudio.com/johnharrison/shinyBS-Demo/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403301542000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iRkuyBviDS2Zsx6pfWeMZ\">here </a>for a demo.<br><br> best Herman<br><br>Op vrijdag 6 juni 2014 21:43:09 UTC+2 schreef <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vee...@gmail.com</a>:</div>"
    ],
